# Phase 17 — SPA routing fallback (Netlify / Cloudflare Pages convention).
#
# Every path that does not match a real file in dist/ is served the React
# app shell; client-side routing (react-router) then resolves the locale
# routes (/fr, /ar, /en, /fr/caftans/…, account and admin areas).
#
# Precedence note: files that DO exist in dist/ — assets, favicons,
# robots.txt, sitemap.xml and the prerendered locale snapshots
# (dist/fr/index.html, dist/ar/index.html, dist/en/index.html generated by
# `npm run prerender`) — are still served directly; only non-file paths
# fall through to the shell.

